+/*
+ * 0152 hotdogb panel brightness (after ios-topaz 0104/0105, MakrSas): the 7T's Samsung sofef03f_m command-mode
+ * DSC panel takes DCS 0x51 with a 10-bit level, high two bits first (dtbo: bl_ctrl_dcs, bl 1..0x3ff,
+ * qcom,mdss-bl-high2bit, default 0x140). Sent through DSI0's command DMA (SM8150 dsi@ae94000, DSI 6G registers
+ * as on topaz's 2.4.1). The DMA address is 32-bit and hotdogb's kernel RAM is above 4 GiB, so the packet sits in
+ * the last MB of ABL's display carve-out (0x9c000000 + 36 MB; the frame uses its first 10.4 MB), which the
+ * display engine already reads. iOS's nits (16.16) map linearly onto 1..0x3ff at SWEET_BL_MAX_NITS.
